Start
 ↓
Load land records (sorted by PropertyID)
 ↓
Input PropertyID
 ↓
low = 0, high = n-1
 ↓
mid = (low + high) / 2
 ↓
Is records[mid].ID == target?
 → YES → Display Record → End
 → NO
 ↓
Is target < records[mid].ID?
 → YES → high = mid - 1
 → NO  → low = mid + 1
 ↓
Repeat until low > high
 ↓
Record Not Found
 ↓
End
